    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Mercenaria is a third-person shooter and role-playing game featuring beautiful girls. You will play as a female college student who joins a mercenary organization due to her disdain for studying, and embark on a series of thrilling missions, fighting against an evil secret organization.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience thrilling gun battles in missions and win bonuses by completing them;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can obtain supplies from the enemy's backpack;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience interesting interactions with other mercenaries;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Admire the beautiful scenery on the distant isolated island.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: This game's account data is stored locally on your device only. No information is sent to any server.</i></p>",
